Package: vabaxos-sounds
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: sound-theme-freedesktop, gsettings-desktop-schemas, alsa-utils
Recommends: gnome-session-canberra
Description: VabaxOS system sounds
 The VabaxOS sound theme: every system sound on the piano, in D major,
 with start-up and shut-down phrases (a service plays the shut-down
 sound). Four more themes: VabaxOS Campane (the timbre of Ubuntu's
 sounds with VabaxOS melodies), Cristallo (bells), Morbido (soft
 mallets) and Aria (gentle pads). They share one idea: rising when
 something starts or arrives, falling when it ends or leaves, so events
 can be told apart without seeing the screen. Sounds the themes do not
 have come from the freedesktop theme.
